    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A linear storyline</strong> in which the protagonist is a special agent infiltrating a restricted area\u2014a former military base. Previously, archaeological excavations were conducted here, and upon uncovering an ancient burial site, scientists released a deadly pathogen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection turns people into mutants, and the survivors have split into warring factions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek salvation,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others attempt to weaponize the virus,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While others kill indiscriminately.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent the spread of the contagion, the zone has been completely isolated\u2014no one can leave. Yet, for unknown reasons, the authorities refuse to destroy the infected territory. Instead, once a month, they send in teams of special agents with classified missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is one such operative, but he has become separated from his squad and must now find them to complete the mission\u2026</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A linear storyline</strong> in which the protagonist is a special agent infiltrating a restricted area\u2014a former military base. Previously, archaeological excavations were conducted here, and upon uncovering an ancient burial site, scientists released a deadly pathogen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infection turns people into mutants, and the survivors have split into warring factions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek salvation,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others attempt to weaponize the virus,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While others kill indiscriminately.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent the spread of the contagion, the zone has been completely isolated\u2014no one can leave. Yet, for unknown reasons, the authorities refuse to destroy the infected territory. Instead, once a month, they send in teams of special agents with classified missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is one such operative, but he has become separated from his squad and must now find them to complete the mission\u2026</p>",
    "short_description": "A special agent infiltrates a restricted zone\u2014a former military base where archaeological excavations awakened an ancient pathogen. The virus mutates people into monsters, and the survivors have split into warring factions.",
